        "original_id": "80fcbda1-559a-51e3-af91-d8b4fcdcb947",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Irad Ortiz Jr.\n- Horses: Lady Eli, Creator\n- Events: Breeders' Cup, 2016 Belmont Stakes, Preakness Stakes, Kentucky Derby, American Triple Crown\n- Topics: Thoroughbred horse racing\n\nFacts:\n- In 2014, Irad Ortiz Jr. won his first Breeders' Cup race on Lady Eli.\n- On June 11, 2016, the 2016 Belmont Stakes was held as the final jewel of Thoroughbred horse racing's American Triple Crown series.\n- The Belmont Stakes is a 1+1/2 mi race known as the \"test of the champion.\"\n- The 2016 Belmont Stakes took place three weeks after the Preakness Stakes and five weeks after the Kentucky Derby.\n- In the 2016 Belmont Stakes, Irad Ortiz Jr. won his first American Classic on Creator.",
